<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gml:doc xmlns:gml="urn:x-gml:canonical"><gdoc><body><h1>Revision codes</h1>
<p>Before the revision.
<gml:rc state="on" code="1" char="|" break="no"/></p><p>A whole revised paragraph.
</p><ul><li>A revised item.
</li><li>Another one.
</li></ul><gml:rc state="off" break="no"/><p>Text before
<gml:rc state="on" code="2" char="?" break="no"/>a revised phrase
<gml:rc state="off" break="no"/>and after.
</p><p>A blank character:
<gml:rc state="on" code="3" char=" " break="no"/>not marked
<gml:rc state="off" break="no"/>done.
<gml:rc state="on" code="1" char="|" break="no"/></p><p>Outer revised
<gml:rc state="on" code="2" char="?" break="no"/>inner revised
<gml:rc state="on" code="1" char="|" break="no"/>outer again.
<gml:rc state="off" break="no"/></p><ol><li>Old item.
<gml:rc state="on" code="1" char="|" break="no"/></li><li>New item.
</li><li>Another new item.
</li></ol><h2>A revised heading</h2>
<xmp xml:space="preserve"><gml:fo fill="no" align="left" overdraw="extend" break="yes"/>revised example
<gml:fo fill="yes" align="justify" overdraw="extend" break="yes"/></xmp><gml:rc state="off" break="no"/><p>One line:
<gml:br break="yes"/><gml:lines word="rc" n="1" char="!" break="no">one marked line</gml:lines>
<gml:br break="yes"/><gml:lines word="rc" n="1" code="2" char="?" break="no">one line of code 2</gml:lines>
<gml:br break="yes"/><gml:lines word="rc" n="1" code="3" char=" " break="no">a line of the blank code</gml:lines>
</p></body></gdoc></gml:doc>
